</div><p class="dialog-lead">
Our club regularly participates in tournaments of varying prestige, offering you an excellent platform to test your capabilities. You can primarily compete in formal exercises (kata) and sparring (kumite) divisions. Sparring matches are governed by the WUKF ruleset, and you have the opportunity to progress from modest, local events all the way to the World Championship. Naturally, competition is entirely optional; however, those who commit to the challenge will receive unwavering support and guidance from our team.
</p>
