<h4 class="dialog-section-title">What Tournaments Can You Enter?</h4>
<ul class="dialog-list">
	<li><i class="fas fa-check-circle"></i> Intra-club championships and local municipal events</li>
	<li><i class="fas fa-check-circle"></i> National Championship of the Hungarian Wado-ryu Karate Federation</li>
	<li><i class="fas fa-check-circle"></i> International WUKF tournaments, European Championships, and World Championships</li>
</ul>
<div class="dialog-cta-note">
<strong>For Beginners:</strong> There is no need to envision world-stage events right away—local, inter-club tournaments serve as the perfect initial steps into the competitive arena.</div>